  "releaseNotes": "1.11.0: [Factory] attribute for delegate-based factory registration; AW005 diagnostic for ambiguous AutoWireScan configs; BenchmarkDotNet benchmarks vs Scrutor. 1.10.1: Fix NuGet packaging — generator DLL now correctly placed in analyzers/dotnet/cs/ so the source generator runs when installed via NuGet. 1.10.0: Convention-based scanning via [AutoWireScan]. 1.9.0: Profile + icon. 1.8.0: Ordered decorators. 1.7.0: AW004. 1.6.0: IncludeSelf. 1.5.0: [HostedService]. 1.4.0: Decorators. 1.3.0: AllowMultiple/DuplicateStrategy/TryX. 1.2.0: Open generics. 1.0.0: Initial.",
